/-! Each one-residual experiment with a reported reference axis reaches
the older appointed Wilson read on its own continued conditional. The
reference charge is independent of fitted numerical coefficients. -/
set_option autoImplicit false
noncomputable section
namespace YM.Integration.WilsonIndependentMatchedPivotStop
open WilsonCoeffUV WilsonCoeffUV.Shard WilsonCoeffUV.Mer
